  "question": "In an experimental model, selective inhibition of angiotensin-converting enzyme (ACE) leads to a marked reduction in systemic vascular resistance and blood pressure. Which mechanistic consequence most directly explains this hemodynamic effect within the renin-angiotensin-aldosterone system?",
