        "Concept": "Perturbation expansion",
        "Explanation": "The energy and wavefunction are expressed as power series in a small parameter λ."
      },
      {
        "Concept": "First-order energy correction",
        "Formula": "E_n^(1) = <ψ_n^(0)|H'|ψ_n^(0)>",
        "Explanation": "The expectation value of the perturbation using the unperturbed wavefunction."
      },
