        "point": "Existing Duty Rule",
        "explanation": "Doing what one is already legally or contractually bound to do is usually not good consideration, although exceptions may apply."
      },
      {
        "point": "Forbearance as Consideration",
        "explanation": "A promise to refrain from doing something one has a legal right to do can constitute valid consideration."
